sequenceDiagram
    participant SPAClient
    participant APIServer

    Note right of SPAClient: User adds a note and hits Save

    Note right of SPAClient: JS intercepts form and handles submission

    SPAClient->>APIServer: POST /new_note_spa with JSON body
    activate APIServer
    APIServer-->>SPAClient: Success response (e.g. 201 Created)
    deactivate APIServer

    Note right of SPAClient: JavaScript appends the new note to the displayed list

    Note right of SPAClient: No page refresh happens
